### 5.8 sinh(1)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/calculator/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"expression": "sinh(1)"}

# 预期 [领域层钉] 200，"result":1.543080634815244
### 5.9 cosh(1)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/calculator/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"expression": "cosh(1)"}

# 预期 [领域层钉] 200，"result":0.7615941559557649
### 5.10 tanh(1)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/calculator/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"expression": "tanh(1)"}


